  "details": "1. Add Scrollview to world.\n\n2. Add VRC Ui Shape to Canvas.\n\n3. Set layer to default.\n\n4. Add UI elements to Content.\n\n5. All UI Elements Navigation is set to None. \n\nNo issues in Play mode, but build and test in VRC this issue happens. Tested with brand new default build and just 1 scrollview. Saw workaround from back in 2020 of setting scroll sensitivity to 0, but causes other problems like no response to scrolling wheel and still an issue even with latest SDK 3.5.2 with Unity 2022.3.6f1.",
